  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Petroleum Corporation of Jamaica (PCJ) Wind Farm, through Keystone Engineering Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PCJ Wind Farm Feasibility Study will support the Petroleum Corporation of Jamaica in developing a 50 MW to 90 MW offshore wind farm in Jamaica. The project will offer commercial opportunities for a range of U.S. equipment and services related to wind power generation.</narrative>
